ds to the highlighted region shown on the number line above?" :question/worked-solution "The red segment contains all values between  $-2$ and $2.$\n\n- the closed circle at $-2$ implies that $x$ can be equal to $-2,$ while\n\n- the closed circle at $2$ implies that $x$ can be equal to $2.$\n\nTherefore, the highlighted region represents $-2\\le x\\le 2.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186492061 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138538 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9106723c-b8b0-586e-8c2b-9bb4f50bc945" :knowledge-point/title "Representing \"And\" Inequalities on Number Lines"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "03910583-d566-5a8b-bfc2-8972fe3ecdd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f6/f6139cea308db19681b8e2239e01f77d4af406a728041aa738b29ee3ce6a603e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186491454} {:answer/id #uuid "7b650c21-47ed-5214-a59e-48d2075d1b3f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/90/901ffc463b1516e30690f41af6225c62a1a3cc3950bc34e28bc5b13ae7314b28.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186491672} {:answer/id #uuid "8698ddac-ea80-50d9-9ad8-a8742ba97aef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/24/2415d02b1c88fbeb254f41d3540b81e20be8fb94da400b77fabca65e40da3b8c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186491685} {:answer/id #uuid "97ae2684-9fda-5d9f-bda1-046e9cd84f79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6f/6fa6ef603a454d9f219ca5967a87a99cc8afabc30105d36879c172b8385fd36b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186491718} {:answer/id #uuid "ad0ec700-72a5-535a-a4a1-e48679183f05" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/49/496986cb7dca8bffb2d2856f3867e48d794f106139d4703e1b2166d9a223781d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186491756}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "03910583-d566-5a8