-1e4da4e83d64" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x<-1$ or $x<1$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186491663} {:answer/id #uuid "a7ce2a8a-1854-5692-8ab6-ce6a4ef7ea6e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x\\ge -1$ or $x\\le 1$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186491747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2fd0b12d-c6d3-5074-bd89-cbaa31e2e2ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x<-1$ or $x>1$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186491548} :answer-field/id #uuid "81599ce3-b5fd-5790-a91f-aa92a6b6fa9f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186491931}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "087d9e13-8fc3-51e2-a62c-c006b17d535f" :question/math-academy-id "q-54820" :question/problem "![](images/f2/f2fc2248ce56cd8209d9f6438d24c7f9e9f805f320ef5549be25282cfbaa6e61.png)\n\nWhich inequality corresponds to the highlighted region shown on the number line above?" :question/worked-solution "The red rays contain all values less than  $-1$ or greater than $1.$ In addition,\n\n- the open circle at $-1$ implies that $x$ cannot be equal to $-1,$ and\n\n- the open circle at $1$ implies that $x$ cannot be equal to $1.$\n\nTherefore, the highlighted region represents $x<-1$ or $x>1.$"}]}
